{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And Lot his brother's son.</b> Lot was Sarah's brother, as it is written 'and Lot son of Haran,' and it is written of Haran 'father of Milcah and father of Yiskah,' and our Sages said: Yiskah — this is Sarah." "<b>And the souls that they made.</b> They say in the passage of Tanna de-Bei Eliyahu: here begins the giving of Torah, and the Targum is proof."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:57.277595206Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}